        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">Required documents include commercial invoice, packing list, bill of lading, certificate of origin, and textile labeling certificates. We also provide compliance documentation for Canadian consumer product safety standards.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="border-bottom:1px solid #e00;padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">How long does shipping from Bangladesh to Canada take?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">Ocean freight to Vancouver takes 30-35 days, to Montreal 32-38 days. Production adds 30-45 days before shipping. Air freight reduces transit to 7-10 days for urgent orders. Weekly sailings ensure reliable schedules.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="border-bottom:1px solid #e00;padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Do you comply with Canadian consumer product safety standards?</h3>
