      </div>
      <div style="padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">What are the payment terms for Canadian brands?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">Standard payment terms are 30% deposit to start production, 70% before shipment. We accept T/T, L/C, and bank transfers. Established Canadian brands may negotiate terms based on order volume and relationship.</p>
